  "releaseNotes": "The Delivery Note Class methods have been adjusted to the latest AADE changes.\n\tA. RequestInvoices Class - method getInvoices: The returned DataTable now returns the field invoiceDeliveryStatus\n\t\n\tB. myDATATools: The method getTransportType has been added.\n\t\n\tC. ProvIlyda Class\n\t     SendInvoice Method: A return sample of ILYDA DataTable has been added to the documentation.\n\t\t getPOSSignature Method: A return sample of ILYDA DataTable has been added to the documentation.\n\t\t \n\tD. VivaWallet Class - method getTransactionDetails: A return sample of VivaWallet DataTable has been added to the documentation.",
